QQuickWindow: Avoid full item-tree scans for child window stacking

Written by Tomasz Kalisiak for Qt, Gerrit change 736359, which fixes
QTBUG-134949 and is not merged upstream:
https://codereview.qt-project.org/c/qt/qtdeclarative/+/736359

Backported to Qt 6.11.2 for melo by melo-foundation on 2026-09-17.

